{:event/body "ADR-2607181900 sets a future script/tooling-host priority of kbb (Kotoba script host, not yet implemented) -> nbb -> (retired: bb), extending the app/library runtime order (ADR-2607100100) into the ops-tooling track this ADR carved out. This does not flip this ADR's decision: nbb remains the canonical script/task host, the bb-retirement waves and verify-no-babashka.cljs gate are unchanged, and no script should assume kbb exists until ADR-2607181900's readiness gate is met. A matching addendum paragraph was also appended to this ADR's own :adr/body (not rewritten) at the same time.", :adr/related ["2607181900" "2607100100"], :adr/id "2607173000", :event/summary "Recorded forward-looking script-host priority (kbb > nbb > retired bb) without changing this ADR's nbb-only decision", :event/agent "claude-code", :event/at "2026-07-18T04:13:23.395Z", :event/actor "Jun Kawasaki", :event/type :amend, :event/seq 1}
